{"id":"sh/ra943il8","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":185,"width":1110,"height":89},"text":"Collect diverse, consented disgust expressions and review labels. Use a fresh identity-disjoint cohort; compare refinements with equal training budgets.","style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#223E34","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/q903ad4n","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":292,"width":1110,"height":89},"text":"Measured baseline:83.01% train vs58.04% validation accuracy. Disgust recall95.45% train vs28.00% validation;330train disgust faces. More epochs alone did not resolve this gap.","style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#223E34","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/dcbm583y","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":399,"width":1110,"height":89},"text":"Resolve physiological source-dimension and timing issues, obtain adequate windows and validate on held-out people and stimulus identities.","style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#223E34","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/sb2lcnmd","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":506,"width":1110,"height":89},"text":"A reproducibility or systems paper is plausible after these experiments. Clinical and patent claims require separate substantiation.","style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#223E34","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
